+# Rental pricing
+
+## Requirement: Long-rental discount
+A rental of 3 days or more SHALL cost 10% less than its full price (days × daily price), rounded to the
+nearest euro cent. Quotes and bookings MUST both show the reduced total.
+
+#### Scenario: Three-day rental
+- WHEN a board at 2550 cents per day is quoted or booked for 3 days
+- THEN the total is 6885 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Two-day rental
+- WHEN a board at 2550 cents per day is quoted or booked for 2 days
+- THEN the total is 5100 cents, with no discount
